OL,3,GNEWSARail safety warning issued ahead
OL,4,Aof Hull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being reminded of the
OL,7,Fdangers of trespassing on a railway
OL,8,Fline at a level crossing ahead of Hull
OL,9,FFair.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail said the Walton Street
OL,12,Fcrossing, next to the fairground site
OL,13,Fand close to Hull station, sees large
OL,14,Fnumbers of pedestrians during the
OL,15,Fannual event.
OL,17,FEarlier, children attended a workshop
OL,18,Fwhere they learned about the dangers of
OL,19,Ftrespassing on the railway.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
